- Evaluate on VAL crops: instance IoU matching F2 (Airbus-like), not union-pixel F2
- Save model_paths.json with absolute paths, and create run_dir/best.pt, run_dir/last.pt shortcuts

No pandas. Uses csv module.

Expected Airbus dataset structure:
